{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-11-1","title":"Proverbs 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>16:11; 20:10,23; Le 19:35,36; De 25:13-16; Ho 12:7; Am 8:5,6 Mic 6:10,11 a just weight. Heb. a perfect stone. 16:11; Eze 45:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-2","title":"Proverbs 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>pride. 3:34,35; 16:18,19; Da 4:30-32; Lu 14:8-11; 18:14 but. 15:33; 1Co 8:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-3","title":"Proverbs 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>The integrity. 5; 13:6; Ps 25:21; 26:1; Joh 7:17 the perverseness. 21:7; 28:18; Ec 7:17; Isa 1:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-4","title":"Proverbs 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Riches. 10:2; Job 36:18,19; Ps 49:6-8; Eze 7:19; Zep 1:18; Mt 16:26 Lu 12:20 but. 12:28; Ge 7:1; Ro 5:17; 1Ti 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-5","title":"Proverbs 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>direct. Heb. rectify. 3; 1:31,32; 5:22; 2Sa 17:23; Es 7:3-10; Ps 9:15,16; Mt 27:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-6","title":"Proverbs 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>righteousness. Ge 30:33; 31:37; 1Sa 12:3,4 but. 5:22; 1Ki 2:32,33,44; Ps 7:16; Ec 10:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-7","title":"Proverbs 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>10:28; 14:32; Ex 15:9,10; Job 8:13,14; 11:20; Ps 146:4; Eze 28:9 Lu 12:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-8","title":"Proverbs 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>21:18; Es 7:9,10; Isa 43:3,4; Da 6:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-9","title":"Proverbs 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>An hypocrite.Or rather, as {chanaiph} properly signifies, a wicked, profligate person, an infidel.</p>\n<p>1Ki 13:18-22; 22:6,20-23; Job 8:13; 34:30; Ps 55:12,20,21; Mt 7:15 Mt 15:5-14; Ac 20:30; 2Co 11:13-15; 2Th 2:8-10; 1Ti 4:1-3 2Pe 2:1-3 through. 2:10-16; 4:5,6; 6:23,24; Mr 13:14,22,23; Eph 4:13,14; 2Pe 3:16-18 1Jo 2:21,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-10","title":"Proverbs 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>it goeth. 28:12,28; Es 8:15,16 when. Ex 15:21; Jud 5:31; Job 27:23; Ps 58:10,11; Re 19:1-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-11","title":"Proverbs 11:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the blessing. 14:34; 29:8; Ge 41:38-42; 45:8; 2Ch 32:20-22; Job 22:30; Ec 9:15 it. 2Sa 20:1; Es 3:8-15; 9:1-16; Jas 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-12","title":"Proverbs 11:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>that. Jud 9:27-29,38; Ne 4:2-4; Ps 123:3,4; Lu 16:14; 18:9; Joh 7:48-52 void of wisdom. Heb. destitute of heart. a man. 10:19; 1Sa 10:27; 2Ki 18:36; 1Pe 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-13","title":"Proverbs 11:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>A tale bearer. Heb. He that walketh being a talebearer. 20:19; Le 19:16 revealeth. 25:9; 26:20-22; Ne 6:17-19 he. 14:5; Jos 2:14,20; Jer 38:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-14","title":"Proverbs 11:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>15:22; 16:22; 24:6; 1Ki 12:1-19; Isa 19:11-14; Ac 15:6-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-15","title":"Proverbs 11:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>that is surety. 6:1-5; 17:18; 20:16; 22:26,27 smart. Heb. be sore broken. suretiship. Heb. those thatstrike hands.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-16","title":"Proverbs 11:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>gracious. 31:30,31; 1Sa 25:32,33; 2Sa 20:16-22; Es 9:25; Mt 26:13; Lu 8:3 Lu 10:42; 21:2-4; Ac 9:39; 16:14,15; Ro 16:2-4,6; 2Jo 1:1 and. Lu 11:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-17","title":"Proverbs 11:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>merciful. Ps 41:1-4; 112:4-9; Isa 32:7,8; 57:1; 58:7-12; Da 4:27; Mt 5:7 Mt 6:14,15; 25:34-40; Lu 6:38; 2Co 9:6-14; Php 4:17 but. 15:27; Job 20:19-23; Ec 4:8; Jas 2:13; 5:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-18","title":"Proverbs 11:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>wicked. 1:18; 5:22; Job 27:13-23; Ec 10:8; Isa 59:5-8; Eph 4:22 but. 22:8; Ps 126:5,6; Ho 10:12,13; Ga 6:8,9; Jas 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-19","title":"Proverbs 11:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>righteousness. 4; 10:16; 12:28; 19:23; Ac 10:35; 1Jo 3:7,10 he. 1:16-19; 7:22,23; 8:36; Ro 2:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-20","title":"Proverbs 11:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>of. 6:14,16-19; 8:13; Ps 18:25,26 upright. 9:7; 15:8; 16:17; 21:29; Ps 11:7; 51:6; 140:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-21","title":"Proverbs 11:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>hand. 16:5; Ex 23:2 the seed. 13:22; Ge 17:7,8; Ps 37:26; 112:1,2; Isa 27:4; Jer 32:39; Ac 2:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-22","title":"Proverbs 11:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>a jewel. 31:30; Eze 16:15-22; Na 3:4-6; 1Pe 3:3,4; 2Pe 2:22 is without. Heb. departed from. 7:10; 9:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-23","title":"Proverbs 11:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>desire. Ps 10:17; 27:4; 37:4; 39:7,8; 119:5,10; Isa 26:9; Jer 17:16; Mt 5:6 expectation. 7; 10:28; Ro 2:8,9; Heb 10:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-24","title":"Proverbs 11:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>that scattereth. 18; 19:17; 28:8; De 15:10; Ps 112:9; Ec 11:1,2,6; Lu 6:38 Ac 11:29,30; 2Co 9:5-11 but. Hag 1:6,9-11; 2:16-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-25","title":"Proverbs 11:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>liberal soul. Heb. soul of blessing. 28:27; Job 29:13-18; 31:16-20; Isa 32:8; 58:7-11; Mt 5:7; 25:34,35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-26","title":"Proverbs 11:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>that withholdeth. Am 8:4-6 blessing. Job 29:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-27","title":"Proverbs 11:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>diligently.{Shochair,} properly, \"rising early to seek\" what is greatly desired.</p>\n<p>he that seekeeth. 17:11; Es 7:10; Ps 7:15,16; 9:15,16; 10:2; 57:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-28","title":"Proverbs 11:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>that. 10:15; De 8:12-14; Job 31:24,25; Ps 52:7; 62:10; Mr 10:24; Lu 12:20 1Ti 6:17 but. Ps 1:3; 52:8; 92:12-14; Isa 60:21; Jer 17:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-29","title":"Proverbs 11:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>that. Ge 34:30; Jos 7:24,25; 1Sa 25:3,17,38; Hab 2:9,10 inherit. Ec 5:16; Ho 8:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-30","title":"Proverbs 11:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>fruit. 3:18; 15:4 and. Da 12:3; Mt 4:19; Joh 4:36; 1Co 9:19-23; 1Th 2:19; Jas 5:20 winneth. Heb. taketh. Lu 5:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-11-31","title":"Proverbs 11:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>2Sa 7:14,15; 12:9-12; 1Ki 13:24; Jer 25:29; 1Co 11:30-32 1Pe 4:17,18</p>"}]}